# Rebuild's Cycling {2} (CR 702.29a): paid with two Moxen it discards the Rebuild from hand and draws a card, at instant speed,
# without casting it - nothing returns to a hand: the Moxen stay on the battlefield (tapped) and the opponent's Mox Pearl is
# untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Rebuild
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rebuild.Activate(Ability: Cycling)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Rebuild
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet
